# Superpowers Skills

A collection of development workflow skills adapted from [obra/superpowers](https://github.com/obra/superpowers) for Cursor. These skills provide systematic approaches to common development tasks.

## Available Skills

All skills are installed at `~/.cursor/skills/` and can be read when needed.

### Process Skills (use first -- they determine HOW to approach tasks)

| Skill | Path | When to Use |
|-------|------|-------------|
| **brainstorming** | `~/.cursor/skills/brainstorming/SKILL.md` | Before any creative work: features, components, modifications |
| **systematic-debugging** | `~/.cursor/skills/systematic-debugging/SKILL.md` | Any bug, test failure, or unexpected behavior |
| **test-driven-development** | `~/.cursor/skills/test-driven-development/SKILL.md` | Before writing any implementation code |
| **verification-before-completion** | `~/.cursor/skills/verification-before-completion/SKILL.md` | Before claiming work is complete or passing |

### Workflow Skills (manage multi-step work)

| Skill | Path | When to Use |
|-------|------|-------------|
| **writing-plans** | `~/.cursor/skills/writing-plans/SKILL.md` | Have a spec/requirements, need implementation plan |
| **executing-plans** | `~/.cursor/skills/executing-plans/SKILL.md` | Have a plan, need to execute in batches |
| **subagent-driven-development** | `~/.cursor/skills/subagent-driven-development/SKILL.md` | Executing plans with subagents in current session |
| **finishing-a-development-branch** | `~/.cursor/skills/finishing-a-development-branch/SKILL.md` | Implementation complete, need to integrate |

